  "description": "Zac built an analytics SaaS, and just hit $1M ARR, But here's the thing... you've probably never heard of it. And that's the whole point!\n\nHis business model is unique and that's exactly why he is successful. So, in this video, we break down why agencies are the dream customer nobody's building for and his advice for doing it all over again. \n\n*30+ Business Ideas in Unsexy Niches:* https://clickhubspot.com/ma5x \n\nFollow Zac: https://www.linkedin.com/in/zcherin/\nCheck out Hiro: https://www.hiroanalytics.com/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Zero to $1M\n0:56 - What's your story?\n1:25 - SaaS breakdown\n2:24 - Business model\n3:01 - Zac's background\n3:34 - Find your overlooked business idea\n4:16 - Tools and tech stack\n5:01 - Building for agencies\n7:10 - Risks to the business\n8:02 - How to build a SaaS like this\n9:19 - Advice for founders\n10:24 - Pat and Gus reflections: the agency model",
